Leading Ocado Group’s International Solutions Finance Team, the Senior Finance Manager drives accounting, financial reporting, and governance across all non-UK commercial entities. This role holds ultimate accountability for the integrity of local statutory financial statements, general ledger accuracy, and board reporting, while serving as the primary finance representative across international entity boards.&nbsp;

Alongside directing and developing a team of Senior Financial Accountants, the SFM owns the relationships with external auditors and local service providers-setting annual timetables and serving as the primary escalation point for complex issues. Furthermore, the role partners closely with Treasury and Tax on funding, transfer pricing, and strategic business cases to ensure seamless, compliant international growth.&nbsp;

